{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_bdhkgt_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_bdhkgt_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "最后的比武",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bdhkgt_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "02890c37593d6987307222c80c47fe5ab64ca095322b9d41903f2d4db8086e65",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这小姑娘，待在这里几天了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她也没有闹事，只是打扫卫生，不算违背左将军的命令。就让她继续做吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这沙子一会儿不扫就又落上一层......孟大叔之前，是时时都在打扫吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "武器架、桌子、椅子都修好了，瓦片也贴回去了，炉火也点起来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里看起来，和师父说的一模一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你找我干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "孟大叔走之后，他们说铸剑坊是你在管了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......师父生前总会提到这里，孟大叔也对我有恩，我想让这里变回原来的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他们说，我应该来找你。我能来帮忙，打扫，修补，我都行的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "用不上，这里有我收拾就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "变回原来的样子有什么用？不会再有人来这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "该留不住的都是留不住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "截云抬起头，看着这座铸剑坊。\n主人爱惜这里的一草一木、一桌一椅，器具用了多年都不曾换，她现在也修好了这里面有所残损的物件。\n但人来来去去，最终只有自己一个人站在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不对，还是不一样，这还不是铸剑坊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里应该有人。有打架的人，有喝酒的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想问问，除了那个擂台，还有哪里能找来人打架吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不知道的话，你们能来和我打架吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......肯定不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你们知道，哪里能找来人喝酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......都说了别喝这么多，你看你，走都走不稳了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那又怎么样？反正都要走了，多喝点就多喝点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你也都看到了，擂台被天灾砸塌了，排行榜也不知道被谁收走了......走之前最后看一眼铸剑坊罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，看一眼就走吧......你难道还想着宗师、孟大哥还是哪个谁把你叫进去比武吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你们要来和我打一架吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......啊......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿纳萨少女站在门口看着两人，她手上的飞轮和她的眼睛一样亮。她身后，巡防营的守军一脸无奈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，你们会武功吧？你们可以和我打架，呃，比武吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们特意走到这里来，就是来比武的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿纳萨少女显然没有开玩笑。两个武人看了她一眼后，面面相觑。\n曾经，也有某个眉眼飞扬的女性像她这样走出来，这样叫住他们，这样大声地说：“快进来，让我看看你们几个练功偷懒了没有！”\n曾经......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊——来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "左将军有令，这里不得进行任何——哎哎哎，你们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "擂台分两边，名号报在先。玉门多侠士，豪气震云天！在下人称“玉门二郎拳”张冲——请指教！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，在下“黄沙一字剑”第五十六代传人林飞沙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还没请教姑娘来自哪门哪派！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "阿......阿纳萨，截云。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是干嘛，怎么还摆开架势了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎、怎么办？把闹事的抓起来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我去把那两条凳子给挪开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "比武的时候，得把擂台上的杂物都清干净，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巡防营守军默默地撤出两步外，原本寂寥的小院重新响起挥拳的风声。\n借着酒意与风中的黄沙，武人欺身而上，双拳挥击，试图压制住截云的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，这才对，这才对！擂台比武，四四方方，划好擂台范围，干干净净......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放屁！要说擂台规矩，你刚才伸手要干什么？别以为我不知道你的暗器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "暗器怎么了？暗器也是我实打实辛苦练的！你之前难道没被我的暗器救过命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然是擂台比武，那就不能用暗器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好好好......我不用，那按规矩，比武点到为止，你要给你的剑刃封上松蜡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好，我给我的飞轮也封上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——再来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几个回合过去，截云已经看出两人醉酒，下盘不稳，出手混乱，自己只需要一招就能把他们打出擂台范围。\n但......\n两个武人眼神越打越清明，越打越正经，仿佛这不是一场醉酒后随意的较量，而是一场真正的擂台比武......\n即使他们的动作已经彻底走形。\n她不由得放缓了自己的攻势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈！就说让你少喝点酒，这下不行了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "笑什么？继续！继续！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "姑娘，比武就要尽兴尽力，我看出来了你在让着我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这可不行！你得用你的全力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——嗬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——呜啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳咳......姑、姑娘这一手真漂亮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好！打得好！......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "截云抹了抹额头上的薄汗，炉火很旺，打架很费力气，所有人都热得满脸通红。\n阿纳萨少女还未从比武中回过神，但她觉得现在就该喝酒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们渴吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "烈刀子，你们常喝的酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "半酣的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，好香，好酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "执勤期间，不能饮酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "姑娘，别一直举着了......军令在身......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿纳萨少女递酒的手纹丝不动，酒碗里的烈刀子和她的眼睛一样清澈。\n如果他不接，少女大概会一直和他耗着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你——我——唉，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "师父说，像这样......请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "酒碗相撞，像是多年前那般发出同样清脆的声响，泼洒出的酒液浸湿了地上的沙砾。\n几人站在铸剑坊的院子里，官兵和武人共同举碗，一仰头，喝干了手中的酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "原来，是这个样子啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿纳萨少女突然懂了。\n她明白了为什么玉门人喜欢打架，为什么大家打完架还能和好如初，一起喝酒。\n她明白了师父为什么这么喜欢这里。\n截云弯下腰，拾起一小撮地上带着酒香的沙砾，放进自己随身的小包中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "师父，这里好像，就是你给我讲的铸剑坊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "截云本想再说些什么，或者再和大家喝上一碗酒，或者像师父给自己描绘的那样，对着风沙和老槐树唱一首歌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好了，陪你们闹了这一场，也差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清醒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清醒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "末班车队离城的时间也差不多到了，该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清醒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "走之前还能比这么一场武，没白来，没白来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清醒的武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "姑娘，江湖再见了，别忘了今天的比武，这可是玉门城最后的比武......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“最后的”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不对，欸，你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "武人没有回应她。\n两人站起了身，把碗放下，一边走一边拍打着身上的尘土，没有再回头。\n截云看着他们的背影，他们走得很稳，仿佛刚刚没有喝过酒，没有醉过，刚刚的一切都没有发生。\n为什么是“最后的”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哎，怎么回事？怎么打完就走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还有你刚刚怎么就给他们挪地方了？你真不怕他们酒后闹事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你没看到他们放在门口的行囊吗？我认得他们两个。他们本来就是外面来的，这次离开玉门，就回老家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这也是最后一次了，他们只是想在这里比一场，那就比上最后一场吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "该留不住的都是留不住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过......他们今天打得真的很尽兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "原来是这样的。\n该留不住的都是留不住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一日后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "截云，铸剑坊的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......道理没有说错，但那天在铸剑坊，我的话说得太重了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唉，你要不要留在玉门？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在这里有不少老友，不论你想干点什么，总能找到一个让你落脚的地方的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "师父都已经放下了，我也在这里真正地打了一架，很尽兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也准备离开这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你打算去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "截云没有回答，她走出了玉门城门，慢慢地唱起了一支歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "太阳落下，明早还从东边升起来♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "月亮升起，明早会从西边落下去♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戈壁上面的裂纹长满了，会有来年的雨水滋润它♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沙漠深处的沙拐枣枯死了，会有地下的泉水救活它♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一阵狂风刮过，裹挟着沙渠翻涌出来的滚滚黄沙，遮住了截云远去的背影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看看江南，也去尝尝菱角，见见师父说的那些，江湖上的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想......自己四处走走，看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看看什么才是真的可以让我像师父那样，记很久很久的人和事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "左将军，我们来领罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "昨天值守期间擅自饮酒，按照军律，当罚军棍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "封条也已经写好了，左将军，关铸剑坊的事......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......这种事情，不需要再来问我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们那时自己喝了那碗酒，你们可以自己做这个决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
